Accordingly, it is directed that applicant - Shivkumar Singh Bhadouria s hall be released on bail in relation to Crime No.565 of 2020 registered at Police Station Gole Ka Mandir, Gwalior (M.P.) for offence punishable under Sections 420, 406 of IPC upon furnishing a personal bond in the sum of Rs.1,00,000/- (Rupees one lac only) with one solvent surety of the same amount to the satisfaction of the Trial Court, for compliance with the following conditions,:(For convenience of understanding by accused and surety, the conditions of bail are also reproduced in Hindi as under):-
